{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:57:17+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:57:17+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Hapag-Lloyd Aktiengesellschaft","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Marine Shipping","country":"Germany","city":"Hamburg","website":"https://www.hapag-lloyd.com","employees":15172,"summary":"Hapag-Lloyd Aktiengesellschaft, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a liner shipping company in Germany, the United States, Asia, the rest of Europe, the Pacific, the Atlantic, Africa, and internationally. It operates through Liner Shipping; and Terminal & Infrastructure segments. The company's vessel and container fleets are used for transporting dry and special cargo, dangerous goods, coffee, and reefer cargo. It also offers bilateral EDI, a directly connected electronic data interchange; application programming interface (API) portals for offers, contract specifications, commercial schedules, track and trace, live reefer, and live positions; WAVE BL service for the digital release of original bills of lading; mobile app and security information services; and INTTRA, Infor Nexus, and CargoSmart portals for the management of supply chain data and connects carriers via one interface. In addition, the company provides inland container transportation services through truck, rail, and barge; hinterland transport from door to door; and logistics services, as well as operates container terminals. As of December 31, 2025, its fleet consisted of 301 container vessels with a transport capacity of 2.4 million twenty-foot equivalent units (TEU). The company was formerly known as Hapag-Lloyd Holding AG and changed its name to Hapag-Lloyd Aktiengesellschaft in August 2013. Hapag-Lloyd Aktiengesellschaft was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Hamburg, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Hapag-Lloyd Aktiengesellschaft, avec ses filiales, opère en tant que compagnie maritime de ligne en Allemagne, aux États-Unis, en Asie, dans le reste de l'Europe, dans le Pacifique, dans l'Atlantique, en Afrique et à l'international. Il opère à travers les segments Liner Shipping; et Terminal & Infrastructure. Les flottes de navires et de conteneurs de la société sont utilisées pour le transport de marchandises sèches et spéciales, de marchandises dangereuses, de café et de marchandises réfrigérées."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":22567620608,"shares_outstanding":175760293,"trailing_pe":377.64703,"forward_pe":-367.97153,"price_to_book":1.2713752,"ev_to_ebitda":18.845,"ev_to_revenue":1.364,"dividend_yield":0.0224,"payout_ratio":8.8235,"beta_yahoo":1.029},"targets":{"current_price":128.4,"mean":111.45,"median":113.75,"high":135.0,"low":90.0,"n_analysts":10,"reco_mean":4.0,"reco_key":"underperform"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":3.718,"eps_low":3.718,"eps_high":3.718,"revenue_avg":6232843850,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-21","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.7363,"institutions_pct":0.22689,"institutions_float_pct":0.86043,"institutions_n":49,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":189,"value":24267,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.1455}],"funds":[{"name":"SCHWAB STRATEGIC TRUST-Schwab Fundamental International Equity ETF","pct":0.00029999999,"shares":57860,"value":7429223,"date":"2026-05-31","chg":-0.1107},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Intl Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.00029999999,"shares":50502,"value":6484456,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.012200001},{"name":"Dimensional ETF Trust-Dimensional International Value ETF","pct":0.0002,"shares":37416,"value":4804214,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0327},{"name":"Tidal ETF Trust-SonicShares Global Shipping ETF","pct":0.0001,"shares":20355,"value":2613581,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.2899001},{"name":"SCHWAB CAPITAL TRT-Schwab Fd.amental Intl Eqy. Index Fd.","pct":0.0001,"shares":105